        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliverance is an atmospheric psychological adventure game in which you play as a postman delivering letters to a deserted city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where each house conceals a piece of his own forgotten life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player explores a 3D hub street, moving between 2D rooms of different houses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >home to mysterious letter recipients: a musician, a girl, a soldier, a librarian, and an artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each letter represents a choice, and each choice changes the city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >revealing the postman's true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/extras/b44ad1e2a21651c1ff03f16b98420a93.avif?t=1777053646\" width=1350 height=1164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Key Gameplay Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🏠 6 unique houses – each representing a distinct story, emotion, and moral dilemma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 💌 Letter mechanics: the player chooses which letter to deliver to the recipient based on the clues found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incorrect letter has dire consequences, while a correct one partially restores the city. • 🌗 A Changing World: As you progress, the street comes to life or dies depending on the player's decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🔍 Exploration: Find items, diaries, and clues that reveal the truth about the residents and the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🕯️ The Final House (House of the Devil): The story's climax, where the player confronts their own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 💀 Two endings: &quot;Acceptance&quot; or &quot;Oblivion&quot; — depend on all the choices made in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Art Style and Atmosphere:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A unique combination of 3D streets and 2D hand-drawn interiors,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creating a dreamlike and unsettling effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A dark, melancholic sound design created using procedural music (Mubert).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The visual changes in the city reflect the protagonist's inner state — from devastation and rain to light and life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/extras/c09238987477087fca21eeecbc8ac202.avif?t=1777053646\" width=1390 height=1130 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliverance is an atmospheric psychological adventure game in which you play as a postman delivering letters to a deserted city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where each house conceals a piece of his own forgotten life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player explores a 3D hub street, moving between 2D rooms of different houses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >home to mysterious letter recipients: a musician, a girl, a soldier, a librarian, and an artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each letter represents a choice, and each choice changes the city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >revealing the postman's true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/extras/b44ad1e2a21651c1ff03f16b98420a93.avif?t=1777053646\" width=1350 height=1164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Key Gameplay Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🏠 6 unique houses – each representing a distinct story, emotion, and moral dilemma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 💌 Letter mechanics: the player chooses which letter to deliver to the recipient based on the clues found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incorrect letter has dire consequences, while a correct one partially restores the city. • 🌗 A Changing World: As you progress, the street comes to life or dies depending on the player's decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🔍 Exploration: Find items, diaries, and clues that reveal the truth about the residents and the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 🕯️ The Final House (House of the Devil): The story's climax, where the player confronts their own past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 💀 Two endings: &quot;Acceptance&quot; or &quot;Oblivion&quot; — depend on all the choices made in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Art Style and Atmosphere:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A unique combination of 3D streets and 2D hand-drawn interiors,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creating a dreamlike and unsettling effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A dark, melancholic sound design created using procedural music (Mubert).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• The visual changes in the city reflect the protagonist's inner state — from devastation and rain to light and life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127950/extras/c09238987477087fca21eeecbc8ac202.avif?t=1777053646\" width=1390 height=1130 /></span></p>",
